    "detailed_description": "<h1>Collect and buff the legendary Arcanas to escape the Inferno</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/852f3a3bbd60a4445a1af5595ed05738.avif?t=1755045213\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/bd77339cd5645d58b0c61a6ab2d6eebb.poster.avif?t=1755045213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/bd77339cd5645d58b0c61a6ab2d6eebb.webm?t=1755045213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>  </p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/18638fea96d1c3009296ddac891957d6.avif?t=1755045213\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limbo</strong>, <strong>Lust</strong>, <strong>Gluttony</strong>, <strong>Greed</strong>, <strong>Anger</strong>, <strong>Heresy</strong>, <strong>Violence</strong>, <strong>Fraud</strong>, and <strong>Treachery</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each dominion is reigned by a ruler embodying the sin of their dominion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/346999a22725969a722035ead28ae01f.poster.avif?t=1755045213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/346999a22725969a722035ead28ae01f.webm?t=1755045213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/b53029c558efbf1788fb00a1fe7a0ef2.avif?t=1755045213\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique blend of Dante\u2019s Inferno and Lovecraftian horror. A <strong>first-person roguelike deckbuilder</strong> using the Major Arcana Tarot Cards to strategize against the horrors lurking in the darkness. <strong>Build the perfect deck</strong>, challenge each ruler of the 9 levels of hell, <i>die often</i>... and repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/20cb5dd0a1ea9b6cad0cbd8ec32cbaa1.poster.avif?t=1755045213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/20cb5dd0a1ea9b6cad0cbd8ec32cbaa1.webm?t=1755045213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/acbc10d9713e73c9074c0a9726d3b4c7.avif?t=1755045213\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pre-strategize and enhance your cards before battles. Apply sigils and brands to apply multiplying effects and push the odds in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/a9deac85c2f1d8397ff5dddc57ba9c67.poster.avif?t=1755045213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/a9deac85c2f1d8397ff5dddc57ba9c67.webm?t=1755045213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/4f29c291a58c387f85c1b3b4ed13575e.avif?t=1755045213\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The nightmarish creatures will catch you in the dark. Use the lantern to bend and manipulate the environment around you as you traverse through the Inferno. Your sanity will be put to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/36f1a01f44224a8c0846ff814e7691c7.poster.avif?t=1755045213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/36f1a01f44224a8c0846ff814e7691c7.webm?t=1755045213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/72747fbf8672edbd6c013d8165ff49e6.avif?t=1755045213\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>First-person Stealth</strong>: Evade the horrific creatures hunting for your soul.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Deckbuilding:</strong> Utilize the power of the Major Arcana Tarot Cards and grow their strength as you descend deeper.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Skill Trait Upgrades:</strong> Gamble your sanity through the underworld\u2019s blackmarket and gain new strengths\u2026 if you\u2019re lucky enough. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management:</strong> Harness the world\u2019s dwindling soul essences to solve challenges within each level.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/2a62d80c486adf3bb96e900eddc7b02f.avif?t=1755045213\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/8c0af71e10506da8fd8e67f546d87f33.avif?t=1755045213\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/e99485fcda673282d3fdfbd8467aa1b6.avif?t=1755045213\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/f4db23802f6408fac7922e44ac71dab8.avif?t=1755045213\" data-has-big /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/18638fea96d1c3009296ddac891957d6.avif?t=1755045213\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limbo</strong>, <strong>Lust</strong>, <strong>Gluttony</strong>, <strong>Greed</strong>, <strong>Anger</strong>, <strong>Heresy</strong>, <strong>Violence</strong>, <strong>Fraud</strong>, and <strong>Treachery</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each dominion is reigned by a ruler embodying the sin of their dominion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/346999a22725969a722035ead28ae01f.poster.avif?t=1755045213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/346999a22725969a722035ead28ae01f.webm?t=1755045213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/b53029c558efbf1788fb00a1fe7a0ef2.avif?t=1755045213\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique blend of Dante\u2019s Inferno and Lovecraftian horror. A <strong>first-person roguelike deckbuilder</strong> using the Major Arcana Tarot Cards to strategize against the horrors lurking in the darkness. <strong>Build the perfect deck</strong>, challenge each ruler of the 9 levels of hell, <i>die often</i>... and repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470790/extras/20cb5dd0a1ea9b6cad0cbd8ec32cbaa1.poster.avif?t=1755045213\" ><source src=\"htt